 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "When the road is hard and the night is long",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.34,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the bread runs out and the strength is gone",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the sword is drawn and the danger near",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "There is one question that rises over fear",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will separate us from the love of Christ?",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I am convinced that neither death nor life",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Neither angels nor rulers",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Neither the present nor the future, nor any powers",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Neither height nor depth",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Nor anything else in all creation",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Will be able to separate us from the love of God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That is in Christ Jesus our Lord",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hardship or distress or persecution",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Famine or nakedness or danger or the sword",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For your sake we are being put to death all day long",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We are regarded as sheep to be slaughtered",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who will separate us from the love of Christ?",
   "heard": 9,
